     "9353e72e-3f84-43f5-94c2-46db22387011"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "ba45250a-cd17-475b-91d3-a46aeacebb24"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<CountingMeasure\>\""], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "81a96c15-a4c1-4a51-8ba4-fd5f0ed8a200"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "0be44d99-0abc-46e4-9a4e-35a483294aa2"], Cell[
    "the causal volume, the number of events of the causal past", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"a65886a9-71ff-44f4-a98a-9c6ab9d964dd"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "ba698083-28f8-4ce7-90df-324c1ca77d14"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<Cardinality\>\""], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "18b7dafe-6cb9-408e-ac3f-7b093f32be11"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "3a7027b6-5096-46c1-89e3-f0ea6403029e"], Cell["\<\
1: the causal past is a set, and its support is its only member\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"b444452d-3fd1-4b74-be68-c4e558941d98"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
